                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm mixed on how the raising sim elements are implemented and how they kind of railroad you into jealousy scenes, but I had a lot of fun on my first run. The horror elements are actually used pretty well in the nightmare sequences, and I liked the more serious bits with the curse progressing reflecting someone dealing with a terminal illness. It's a clever parallel that hit harder then I expected.\n\nI also like how the primary artist really knew how to sell the supernatural and horror stuff. The cursed variants of the main characters are REALLY cool to see.",
